<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Forward in talks on MacPhail,Gentyre stakes.</title>
<headline>Forward in talks on MacPhail,Gentyre stakes.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Discussions regarding the shareholdings of Forward Corp Ltd and minority holders in Gentyre Industries Ltd and MacPhail Holdings Ltd were taking place, the firms said on Monday.</p>
<p>They said these talks include an evaluation of the merits of retaining the listings of Gentyre and MacPhail on the Johannesburg Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>As the talks may impact on the share prices of the three companies, shareholders were advised to exercise caution in their sharedealings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
